\code{if_bootstrap_count} adds percentile intervals. Supplied analysis weights
are frozen, so propensity-score estimation uncertainty is not propagated.
A matched block with \code{if_match_match_id} resamples whole matched sets;
without the id it resamples rows. The seed controls this function only and
does not establish shared draws with \code{\link[=estimate_hr]{estimate_hr()}} or \code{\link[=estimate_ir]{estimate_ir()}}.
